  "title": "Pork Chops with Mushroom Onion Gravy",
  "description": "Pork Chops smothered in mushroom onion gravy. The gravy is easy and cooks with the chops in the oven. It is great over noodles or rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Jen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-03-26T15:33:42-05:00",
